Package: tpi-proxy
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: egite <139096069+egite@users.noreply.github.com>
Section: net
Priority: optional
Depends: python3-light, python3-asyncio, python3-logging
Description: EnvisaLink TPI multiplexing proxy
 Holds the single TPI connection the EnvisaLink allows and fans it out so
 Home Assistant, a web app and other TPI clients can share it. Pure-Python
 asyncio, no compiled code. Configure /etc/tpi-proxy.conf, then enable and
 start the evl-tpi-proxy service.
